{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05291","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 李迥秀","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙界人王塔，金绳梵帝游。\n言从[只]树赏，行翫菊丛秋。\n御酒调甘露，天花拂彩旒。\n尧年将佛日，同此庆时休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李迥秀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}